OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 92, dies after being struck
OL,4,Aby lorry in Inverness city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 92-year-old woman has died after she
OL,7,Fwas struck by a lorry in Inverness.
OL,9,FEmergency services including fire
OL,10,Fengines and a critical care paramedic
OL,11,Fwere sent to Academy Street in the city
OL,12,Fcentre at about 09:50. The woman was
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,15,FThe street was closed for about seven
OL,16,Fhours while police investigations took
OL,17,Fplace, and reopened at about 17:00.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland said extensive
OL,20,Finquiries are ongoing to establish the
OL,21,Ffull circumstances and has urged anyone
OL,22,Fwith information to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
